<title>UK: Bank Vontobel warrants on Alusuisse-Lonza.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel warrants on Alusuisse-Lonza.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel says it has issued three million call warrants, on Alusuisse-Lonza Holding Ltd.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1000.00 SFR	     PREMIUM	13.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.00 SFR		  GEARING	15.6 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.NOV.96-20.NOV.97   PAYDATE	14.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
